<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/NACE2.1_NACE2_1061">
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">10.61: 
- grain milling: production of flour, semolina, groats, meal or pellets of wheat, rye, oats, maize (corn) or other cereal grains
- rice milling: production of husked, milled, polished, glazed, parboiled or converted rice; production of rice flour
- vegetable milling: production of flour or meal of dried leguminous vegetables, of roots or tubers, or of edible nuts
- manufacture of cereal breakfast foods
- manufacture of flour mixes and prepared blended flour and dough for bread, cakes, biscuits, pancakes, etc.</skos:scopeNote>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">10.86: 
- manufacture of gluten-free products</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/NACE2.1_NACE2_1062">
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">10.86: 
- manufacture of gluten-free products</skos:scopeNote>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">10.62: 
- manufacture of starches from rice, potatoes, maize etc.
- wet corn milling
- manufacture of glucose, glucose syrup, maltose, inulin etc.
- manufacture of gluten
- manufacture of tapioca and tapioca substitutes prepared from starch
- manufacture of corn oil</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/NACE2.1_NACE2_1071">
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">10.86: 
- manufacture of gluten-free products</skos:scopeNote>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">10.71: 
- manufacture of bakery products:
 • bread and rolls
 • pastry, cakes, pies, tarts, pancakes, waffles etc.
- manufacture of pre-baked bread</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/NACE2.1_NACE2_1072">
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">10.86: 
- manufacture of gluten-free products</skos:scopeNote>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">10.72: 
- manufacture of rusks, biscuits and other dry bakery products
- manufacture of preserved pastry goods, cakes and waffles
- manufacture of snack products (cookies, crackers, pretzels etc.), whether sweet or salted
- manufacture of breadcrumbs, obtained by grinding toasted bread</skos:scopeNote>
