<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/NACE2.1_NACE2_9510">
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">95.11: 
- repair and maintenance of electronic equipment, e.g. computers and computing machinery, peripheral and communication equipment.
- repair and maintenance of:
 • desktop computers
 • laptop computers
 • magnetic disc drives and flash drives
 • optical disc drives
 • renovation of discs
 • printers
 • monitors
 • keyboards
 • webcams
 • headsets, including in-ear wireless headsets
 • mice, joysticks and trackball accessories
 • internal and external computer modems
 • dedicated computer terminals
 • computer servers
 • scanners, including bar code scanners
 • smart card readers
 • virtual reality helmets
 • computer projectors
 • smart telephones and tablets
- repair and maintenance of computer terminals like automatic teller machines (ATMs) and point-of-sale (POS) terminals, not mechanically operated
- repair and maintenance of hand-held computers (PDAs)</skos:scopeNote>
	<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">95.12: 
- repair and maintenance of communications equipment, e.g.:
 • cordless telephones
 • mobile telephones
 • carrier equipment modems
 • telefax machines
 • communications transmission equipment (e.g. routers, bridges, modems)
 • two-way radios
 • commercial TV and video cameras</skos:scopeNote>
</rdf:Description>

