- manufacture of solid fuels from biomass, see 16.26
- manufacture of liquid biofuels, see 20.51</xkos:exclusionNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/2011">
	<xkos:exclusionNote xml:lang="en">This class excludes:
- extraction of methane, ethane, butane or propane, see 06.20
- liquefaction and regasification of natural gas for the purpose of transport, done at the mine site, see 09.10
