- manufacture of gaseous fuels from coal, waste, etc., see 35.21
- manufacture of hydrogen for the provision as a gaseous fuel through a permanent supply network, see 35.21</xkos:exclusionNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/2012">
