<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/64">
	<xkos:exclusionNote xml:lang="en">This division excludes the activities of promotional institutions for economic development through long-term investments at local, regional and national level provided that they act as the government’s arm for the execution of their public policy mandate, see 84.13.</xkos:exclusionNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/6411">
	<xkos:exclusionNote xml:lang="en">This class excludes:
- operation and supervision of financial markets other than by central banks and public authorities, see 66.11
