- financial and market regulation relating to the conduct of business and consumer protection and other wider financial regulatory activities, see 84.13</xkos:exclusionNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/6612">
	<xkos:exclusionNote xml:lang="en">This class excludes:
