- publishing of insurance software/applications, see 58.29</xkos:exclusionNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/6630">
	<xkos:exclusionNote xml:lang="en">This class excludes:
- dealing in financial markets on own account, see 64.99
- management of real estate, see division 68
- management of public funds and public debt services, see 84.11</xkos:exclusionNote>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/681">
	<xkos:exclusionNote xml:lang="en">This group excludes:
