</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/ux2/nace2.1/7420">
	<xkos:exclusionNote xml:lang="en">This class excludes:
- activities of printing photographs (from mobile telephones, memory cards, universal serial bus (USB) and other electronic supports), see 18.12
